          "desc": "· Agent <color=#FE437E>Ether DMG</color> increases by 20%.\n· When Agents inflict an <color=#FFFFFF>Attribute Anomaly</color> on enemies, their DEF is reduced by 15%, and All-Attribute RES is reduced by 15% for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
